     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You need Entry 3 in Row 13, but there is no Row 13 in the Pascal triangle provided. You need to make one. You do not need to make the whole row. The entries in the new row are the sum of the entries sitting on its “shoulders.”</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Row 10</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>210</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>…</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Row 11</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>165</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>330</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>…</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Row 12</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>220</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>495</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>…</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Row 13</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>286</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>781</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>…</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ENTRY</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Entry 3 in Row 13 is 286.</p>\n"
    },
